{"page":158,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:58","surah":7,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَلَدُ ٱلطَّيِّبُ يَخْرُجُ نَبَاتُهُۥ بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِۦ ۖ وَٱلَّذِى خَبُثَ لَا يَخْرُجُ إِلَّا نَكِدًا ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ نُصَرِّفُ ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ لِقَوْمٍ يَشْكُرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Vegetation comes out of good land in abundance, by the will of its Lord, but out of bad land only scantily: We explain Our Revelations in various ways to those who give thanks.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلْبَلَدُ","en_gloss":"And the land ","transliteration":"wal-baladu","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلطَّيِّبُ","en_gloss":"[the] pure","transliteration":"l-ṭayibu","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"comes forth","transliteration":"yakhruju","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَبَاتُهُۥ","en_gloss":"its vegetation","transliteration":"nabātuhu","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِإِذْنِ","en_gloss":"by (the) permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'ni","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَبِّهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) its Lord","transliteration":"rabbihi","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"but which","transliteration":"wa-alladhī","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"خَبُثَ","en_gloss":"is bad ","transliteration":"khabutha","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَخْرُجُ","en_gloss":"come forth","transliteration":"yakhruju","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَكِدًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"(with) difficulty","transliteration":"nakidan","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":14,"ar":"نُصَرِّفُ","en_gloss":"We explain","transliteration":"nuṣarrifu","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"l-āyāti","verse_key":"7:58"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","en_gloss":"for a peopl